body:
The data pack related to magic combines adventure and technology. 

- No infinite water;
- A new mechanism: evolution (not yet perfected).
- 3 new enchantments;
- A series of weapons;
- A series of potions;
- Some new food;
- Two blocks (water reservoir and water well).
- Two stronger bosses.
- A new unit - Hydropower.

Currently, the data pack is made by SoAlanLabor in person. In the future, more content will be added. If you encounter any bugs or have better suggestions during the game, please feel free to discuss with the author.
By the way, if you learn Chinese well, you can click the link to learn more.

[Data pack's Chinese wiki](https://www.mcmod.cn/class/11033.html)
